{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "13d0f15f-a55e-8114-9dfe-570a5e499ab0",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11T13:34:24-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget McCarthy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:28:21-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:28:27-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I think I'm calling about a noise. Maybe I have the right office, I'm not sure. Is this where I'd complain about a noise?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:28:39-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be. Let me hear a little more about it, and then I'll tell you where it should go. What kind of noise is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:28:51-04:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's sort of a loud humming, I think from the heating and cooling unit, the big one on the roof, or maybe it's on the side of the building. It's at the restaurant next door to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:08-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A big rooftop or side unit at the restaurant next door, humming loudly. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:17-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I think that's right. It's a sort of droning, and it rattles a little too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:25-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And how long has it been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:29-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the weekend, I think. Saturday, maybe. It was fine before that, I believe. Then Saturday afternoon it started up and it hasn't really stopped."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:40-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's been running since Saturday, pretty much constantly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:45-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so, yes. Day and night, sort of. It's a bit quieter when the restaurant is closed, maybe, but I still hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:29:56-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Is it keeping you up at night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:00-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe a little. I'd say it's mostly the hum in the back bedroom. I'm not sure what's allowed, you see. I don't know if there's a rule about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:13-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are noise rules, yes, and which office handles it depends on the situation. Can I ask, have you spoken to the restaurant about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:24-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I stopped in on Monday and spoke to a young man at the counter. He said he'd tell the manager. I don't think anything has changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:36-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's helpful to know. You tried them first, and it's still going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:42-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. So I wondered, should I be calling the police instead? The non-emergency line, I mean. I think there's one. I wouldn't want to bother them if it's not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:30:55-04:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. For a noise that's happening right now, the police non-emergency line is generally the one that can send someone to listen to it. It's not a bother, that's what the line is for. Since this is a continuing problem with a piece of equipment, I can also take down your complaint here and pass it along to the right city office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:31:23-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I see. Maybe I should do both, then? I think I'd like it written down somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:31:31-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think that's reasonable. I'll make a note here, and you can call the non-emergency line when it's loud. Let me get some details. Your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:31:43-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bridget McCarthy. M-c-C-a-r-t-h-y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:31:45-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. McCarthy. And a callback number, in case someone needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:31:52-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0181. That's the house phone. I think it rings loudly enough, but sometimes I'm in the back room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:01-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:04-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:06-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the name of the restaurant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:09-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, dear. I think it's called the Harbor Table, or maybe it's Harbor Kitchen. It's the one with the green awning. I'd have to look out the window to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:23-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's alright, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:26-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I can't quite see the sign from here. I think it's Harbor Table. Sort of sure. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:34-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Harbor Table, green awning, next door. I'll write it that way and note that you weren't certain on the name. Do you want to give me your address, or would you rather not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:49-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think I'd rather not, if that's alright. Is it needed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:32:55-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. The name of the restaurant and the description of the noise will be enough for me to pass this along. If someone needs more, they can call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:33:09-04:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. Thank you. I'm sorry, I'm a bit slow today. I've been up since the hum woke me, and I've been busy with a project. I'm sort of teaching myself to cut hair, from videos, and I keep losing my place when the noise starts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:33:29-04:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I can see how a constant hum would make that hard. Let me read this back. Loud heating and cooling unit at the restaurant next door, Harbor Table, green awning. Running since Saturday, constant. You spoke to staff on Monday. Callback is the number you gave. Anything to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:33:51-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think that's all of it. Maybe just that it rattles. You have that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:33:58-04:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the rattle noted. I'll send it on today. If it's loud this evening, go ahead and call the police non-emergency line as well, and tell them it's been going since Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:34:13-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will do that. Thank you, Mr. Haskell, was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:34:18-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Owen is fine. You take care, Ms. McCarthy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-11T13:34:22-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
